  <metadata>
    <name>trails-of-thassos</name>
    <desc>Off-road adventure on the beautiful Greek island of Thassos, through remote forest trails, rugged mountain roads, and breathtaking landscapes.
This ride was done on a Royal Enfield Himalayan 450, the 19th of September 2026.</desc>
